  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"202\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"63\">Brand introduction</strong><br data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"66\">RayCue creates innovative, design-driven tech accessories that enhance connectivity, productivity, and the Apple ecosystem experience.</p><p data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"623\"><strong data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"227\">Product description</strong><br data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"230\">RayCue’s multifunctional hubs and docking stations are engineered for professionals, creators, and tech enthusiasts who demand high-speed performance, seamless integration, and intelligent design — all within a refined, Apple-inspired aesthetic. Whether you're expanding your workspace, managing data, or customizing your setup, RayCue delivers powerful solutions without compromising style.</p><p data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"825\"><strong data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"655\">USP (Unique Selling Point)</strong><br data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"658\">Seamless expansion. Intelligent design. Engineered for Apple perfection.<br data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"733\">(RayCue delivers pro-grade connectivity and elegant integration for your Apple ecosystem.)</p><p data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"1179\"><strong data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"846\">Payment options</strong><br data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"849\">We offer a<strong>&nbsp;10% commission&nbsp;</strong>on confirmed orders. With our high average order value, you can expect to reach the<strong>&nbsp;$100 payout</strong> threshold in as few as <strong>10 orders</strong>. Once your accumulated commission exceeds $100, we’ll process your payment. Please note that orders must remain valid for at least one month before commission payout. Payments are handled around the <strong>20th</strong> of each month via<strong>&nbsp;PayPal</strong></p></div></div>",
